<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est 95,000, Wk ago 121,000, and Yr ago 104,00 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady to weak compared with mid-session Friday. Trade was slow for light demand and offerings. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
